{"text":"比丘道仙供養彌勒像一勘。比丘道仙敬造，仰爲師僧、父母、兄弟、姐妹、眷屬及法界含生同生兜率，面奉彌勒。寶方寺。永熙三年歲在甲寅，四月十三日造。","tags":[{"name":"PersonName","term":"道仙","refId":null,"text":"道仙","start":2,"end":4},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"供養","refId":null,"text":"供養","start":4,"end":6},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"彌勒","refId":null,"text":"彌勒","start":6,"end":8},{"name":"PersonName","term":"道仙","refId":null,"text":"道仙","start":14,"end":16},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"法界","refId":null,"text":"法界","start":36,"end":38},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"眾生","refId":null,"text":"含生","start":38,"end":40},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"兜率","refId":null,"text":"兜率","start":42,"end":44},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"彌勒","refId":null,"text":"彌勒","start":47,"end":49},{"name":"LocName","term":"寶方寺","refId":"PL000000058125","text":"寶方寺","start":50,"end":53}]}